Committed LLM response cache.

Every file here is one recorded model response, named by the sha256 of the
request that produced it (see core/llm/client.cache_key). These files are
COMMITTED ON PURPOSE: they are what makes the Stage 4 evaluation reproducible
without an API key and without spend. Delete them only when deliberately
re-recording, and re-run the eval in the same commit if you do.
